{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/9828e86974ff33f40dc2da8fe4d69571.avif?t=1764120494\" width=399 height=157 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;The Authority,&quot; the cosmic organization responsible for managing the life-death cycle of... everything.<br>You are a reaper - technically an employee - tasked with serving Final Notices to immortal entities who refuse to retire on schedule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As with most jobs, you're expected to learn on the job, break a few things, and file the relevant forms afterward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/c61a5ef437f5bd053a3a8ad7812432f0.poster.avif?t=1764120494\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/c61a5ef437f5bd053a3a8ad7812432f0.webm?t=1764120494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/c61a5ef437f5bd053a3a8ad7812432f0.mp4?t=1764120494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Notice is a dense, puzzle-like solo deckbuilder where you are encouraged - <i>professionally obligated, even</i> - to lose. Losing reveals weaknesses. Weaknesses become strategies. Strategies become victories you can brag about in the break room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're hoping to win your first fight, <i><strong>you're in the wrong department.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/04b788452f9cdfb7638e4f00e1f55f63.avif?t=1764120494\" width=1560 height=327 /></span>YOUR DAILY TASKS WILL INCLUDE:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimenting with 110+ cards designed to synergize, contradict each other, and occasionally betray you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing mortis, a soul-derived resource that Health &amp; Safety insists is &quot;safe enough&quot; to use unsupervised.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building and rebuilding decks after each inevitable workplace accident.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battling procedurally generated bosses built from adjective-domain combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracking status effects like Banished, Fogged, and Entombed - all of which are definitely covered under your contract. Maybe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revising your strategy because your starter deck is about as effective as a stapler against a hurricane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/ec8407b8c8070425970cda4e9ef8b9a1.poster.avif?t=1764120494\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/ec8407b8c8070425970cda4e9ef8b9a1.webm?t=1764120494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/ec8407b8c8070425970cda4e9ef8b9a1.mp4?t=1764120494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE INTENDED LOOP (PLEASE READ - HR INSISTS):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempt a boss fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose. (This is normal. Please stop filing incident reports.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the deckbuilder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rethink your life choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a synergy you didn't notice before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit a harder boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restart at Step 2 until you clock out or management intervenes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy figuring things out yourself, welcome aboard.<br>If you prefer a guided tour and guaranteed wins, HR recommends transferring to another department.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/7f43e04f8530f9ba404df9cfd9e65cfd.poster.avif?t=1764120494\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/7f43e04f8530f9ba404df9cfd9e65cfd.webm?t=1764120494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/7f43e04f8530f9ba404df9cfd9e65cfd.mp4?t=1764120494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORKING CONDITIONS:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounty Mode lets you fight curated bosses for training and performance evaluation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Mode exists for employees seeking &quot;career development&quot; or &quot;creative self-destruction.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is dense by design - a puzzle you unpack through repetition, failure, and questionable perseverance.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR FEEDBACK MATTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Notice is under active development. Submissions are reviewed. Suggestions are logged. Non-compliance is\u2026 noted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/f697fd7973101d29953902aab1941ba5.avif?t=1764120494\" width=855 height=157 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Wishlist on Steam to remain in good standing.</strong></i></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816330?t=1764120494","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/bb4f804b9c48feddd4bee9c9a38cd3bf8d54ebb2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764120494","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/f502ea568eb28b31d5dc881bb76ffe0b87e5f354/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764120494","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/f502ea568eb28b31d5dc881bb76ffe0b87e5f354/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764120494","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3816370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/9828e86974ff33f40dc2da8fe4d69571.avif?t=1764120494\" width=399 height=157 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;The Authority,&quot; the cosmic organization responsible for managing the life-death cycle of... everything.<br>You are a reaper - technically an employee - tasked with serving Final Notices to immortal entities who refuse to retire on schedule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As with most jobs, you're expected to learn on the job, break a few things, and file the relevant forms afterward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/c61a5ef437f5bd053a3a8ad7812432f0.poster.avif?t=1764120494\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/c61a5ef437f5bd053a3a8ad7812432f0.webm?t=1764120494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/c61a5ef437f5bd053a3a8ad7812432f0.mp4?t=1764120494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Notice is a dense, puzzle-like solo deckbuilder where you are encouraged - <i>professionally obligated, even</i> - to lose. Losing reveals weaknesses. Weaknesses become strategies. Strategies become victories you can brag about in the break room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're hoping to win your first fight, <i><strong>you're in the wrong department.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/04b788452f9cdfb7638e4f00e1f55f63.avif?t=1764120494\" width=1560 height=327 /></span>YOUR DAILY TASKS WILL INCLUDE:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimenting with 110+ cards designed to synergize, contradict each other, and occasionally betray you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing mortis, a soul-derived resource that Health &amp; Safety insists is &quot;safe enough&quot; to use unsupervised.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building and rebuilding decks after each inevitable workplace accident.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battling procedurally generated bosses built from adjective-domain combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracking status effects like Banished, Fogged, and Entombed - all of which are definitely covered under your contract. Maybe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revising your strategy because your starter deck is about as effective as a stapler against a hurricane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/ec8407b8c8070425970cda4e9ef8b9a1.poster.avif?t=1764120494\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/ec8407b8c8070425970cda4e9ef8b9a1.webm?t=1764120494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816330/extras/ec8407b8c8070425970cda4e9ef8b9a1.mp4?t=1764120494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE INTENDED LOOP (PLEASE READ - HR INSISTS):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempt a boss fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose. (This is normal. Please stop filing incident reports.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the deckbuilder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rethink your life choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a synergy you didn't notice before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit a harder boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restart at Step 2 until you clock out or management intervenes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy figuring things out yourself, welcome aboard.<br>If you prefer a guided tour and guaranteed wins, HR recommends transferring to another department.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mut